{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "toolu_01WA1oSYoVVaBHKFtwZEhyzN", "type": "tool_result", "content": "1\t# ledgerline\n2\t\n3\tLedgerline is the invoicing and billing servce for Acme. It creates invoices,\n4\tcomputes tax, posts finalized invoices to the external ledger, and exports\n5\tmonthly reports.\n6\t\n7\t## Layout\n8\t\n9\t- `src/billing/` - money, invoices, refunds, and tax logic\n10\t- `src/api/` - the HTTP endpoints\n11\t- `migrations/` - the SQL schema migrations\n12\t- `scripts/` - operational scripts\n13\t\n14\t## Development\n15\t\n16\tInstall the dependancies with `pip install -e .[dev]`, then run the tests.\n17\t"}]}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "session_id": "889d7afd-d338-42ab-a48e-bb129f2a447b", "uuid": "260f3b1e-10ba-49fa-a0fa-ce910003e1e6", "timestamp": "2026-10-02T00:22:27.556Z", "tool_use_result": {"type": "text", "file": {"filePath": "/tmp/mte-nc-readme-z0qez7hj/ledgerline/README.md", "content": "# ledgerline\n\nLedgerline is the invoicing and billing servce for Acme. It creates invoices,\ncomputes tax, posts finalized invoices to the external ledger, and exports\nmonthly reports.\n\n## Layout\n\n- `src/billing/` - money, invoices, refunds, and tax logic\n- `src/api/` - the HTTP endpoints\n- `migrations/` - the SQL schema migrations\n- `scripts/` - operational scripts\n\n## Development\n\nInstall the dependancies with `pip install -e .[dev]`, then run the tests.\n", "numLines": 17, "startLine": 1, "totalLines": 17}}}
